---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const APP_URL = "https://myprettycloud-frontend.cleverapps.io";
const updated = "June 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & privacy · myprettycloud"
  description="myprettycloud collects no personal data, runs no tracking, and is hosted entirely on Clever Cloud, a European sovereign host."
>
  <main class="terms container">
    <header class="terms__head">
      <p class="terms__eyebrow">Last updated · {updated}</p>
      <h1>Terms &amp; privacy</h1>
      <p class="terms__lede">
        The short version: we don't want your personal data, we don't track you, and everything
        runs on a European sovereign host. Here it is in full — it's deliberately brief.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="terms__block" aria-labelledby="data-title">
      <h2 id="data-title">No personal data</h2>
      <p>
        myprettycloud does not collect, store, or sell personal data. There is no advertising, no
        analytics, no tracking pixels, no third-party trackers, and no profiling.
      </p>
      <p>To do its job, the app only ever handles two operational things:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Your Clever Cloud access token</strong> — obtained when you sign in with Clever
          Cloud, stored encrypted, and used solely to read the state of <em>your own</em>
          infrastructure. We never use it for anything else, and you can revoke it from Clever
          Cloud at any time.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Your city layout and workflows</strong> — the buildings you place and the
          alerting rules you write, so the app can show your city and run your rules. That's
          configuration you created, not data about you.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We don't sign you up for anything, send you marketing, or share any of the above with third
        parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms__block" aria-labelledby="host-title">
      <h2 id="host-title">Hosted on Clever Cloud, a sovereign host</h2>
      <p>
        The entire product — the backend, the web app, and this site — is hosted on
        <a href="https://www.clever-cloud.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Clever Cloud</a
        >, a French, European cloud provider. Your data stays within that sovereign infrastructure;
        it is not handed off to non-European platforms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="terms__block" aria-labelledby="use-title">
      <h2 id="use-title">Using the service</h2>
      <p>
        myprettycloud is provided as-is, without warranty, as a way to visualise and monitor your
        Clever Cloud infrastructure. It is not affiliated with the 3D asset authors it credits (see
        our <a href="/thanks">thanks page</a>). Use it to watch your own infrastructure; don't use
        it to attempt to access infrastructure that isn't yours.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions about any of this? The app and its source speak for themselves — open
        <a href={APP_URL}>the app</a> or read the <a href="/docs">documentation</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="terms__back"><a href="/">← Back home</a></p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .terms {
    max-width: 44rem;
    padding-block: 8rem var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .terms__head {
    margin-block-end: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .terms__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .terms__head h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }

  .terms__lede {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  .terms__block {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-block-start: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: var(--rule-hair) solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .terms__block h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-md);
  }

  .terms__block p,
  .terms__block li {
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .terms__block p {
    margin-block: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .terms__block ul {
    margin-block: var(--space-sm);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-lg);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .terms__block strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .terms__block a {
    color: var(--color-accent-bright);
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-accent-bright) 45%, transparent);
  }

  .terms__block a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent-bright);
  }

  .terms__back {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .terms__back a {
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .terms__back a:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .terms {
      padding-block-start: 6.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
